### UStudent API - Authentication Endpoints
### Base URL: http://localhost:8080

### Login as Student (John)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "john_student",
  "password": "test"
}

### Login as Student (Jane)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "jane_student"
}

### Login as Teacher (Dr. Wilson)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "prof_wilson"
}

### Login as Teacher (Dr. Brown)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "prof_brown"
}

### Test Invalid Login
POST http://localhost:8080/api/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "invalid_user",
  "password": "password"
}